/ Master loader — load all modules in dependency order
/ Usage: \l q/load.q
/ After loading, all .trinary, .dirs, .syn, .brain, .vision, .engine namespaces are available.

\l q/modules/trinary.q
\l q/modules/directions.q
\l q/modules/synapses.q
\l q/modules/brain.q
\l q/modules/vision.q
\l q/modules/brain_engine.q
